sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Owner
    participant Agent as MCP client (agent)
    participant OAuth as jev-mcp OAuth endpoints
    participant Consent as /consent
    participant MCP as /mcp tools
    participant Svc as ToolService
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant TS as TypeSafe API

    rect rgb(253, 242, 248)
        note over Agent,DB: One-time authorization per agent
        Agent->>OAuth: POST /register (client_name)
        OAuth->>DB: store client
        OAuth-->>Agent: client_id
        Agent->>OAuth: GET /authorize (PKCE challenge, resource=/mcp)
        OAuth->>DB: store pending consent (10 min)
        OAuth-->>Agent: 302 → /consent?request=…
        Agent->>Owner: opens browser
        Owner->>Consent: enters owner password
        Consent->>DB: delete pending, store hashed code
        Consent-->>Agent: 302 → redirect_uri?code&state
        Agent->>OAuth: POST /token (code + PKCE verifier)
        OAuth->>DB: mark code used, store hashed access + refresh tokens
        OAuth-->>Agent: access token (1 h) + refresh token (30 d)
    end

    rect rgb(236, 253, 245)
        note over Agent,TS: Design once with ask_jev, then persist
        Agent->>MCP: ask_jev(state, questions)
        MCP->>Svc: validate questions and backtick paths
        Svc->>TS: POST /v1/systemone
        TS-->>Svc: typed answers + usage
        Svc->>DB: log run (tool_name = null)
        MCP-->>Agent: answers
        Agent->>MCP: create_tool(name, docs, inputs, context, questions)
        MCP->>Svc: validate ToolSpec
        Svc->>DB: insert tool v1 (created_by = client_id)
        MCP-->>Agent: saved definition
    end

    rect rgb(238, 242, 255)
        note over Agent,TS: Any later session, any authorized agent
        Agent->>MCP: list_tools → get_tool(name)
        MCP-->>Agent: docs + declared inputs
        Agent->>MCP: run_tool(name, inputs)
        MCP->>Svc: check required inputs and JSON types
        Svc->>DB: load tool
        Svc->>TS: state = context + inputs, saved questions, model
        TS-->>Svc: answers
        Svc->>DB: log run (version, client_id, usage, latency)
        MCP-->>Agent: answers + run_id
    end
